[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=44 format=3 uid="uid://milk_glass_theme"]

; Milk-glass UI settings shared by the dialogue balloon, the title screen and
; every overlay. Edit colours/radii here once; both scenes pick them up.
; Palette: milk white, cream, pale butter accent, grey-brown ink. No text on
; icon buttons: IconButton / TitleButton variations tint the white SVG icons.

